1114	    <div class="policies">
1115	      <div class="policy flag">
1116	        <h3>Using AI in this course <span class="k">AI POLICY</span></h3>
1117	        <p>AI tools are welcome here — this is a course about using them well. Use them to brainstorm, explain, and get unstuck, but the thinking and the final work must be yours.</p>
1118	        <p>When AI meaningfully shaped a submission, say so and how. Always verify what it tells you against a real source — confident wrong answers are the norm, not the exception.</p>
1119	      </div>
1120	      <div class="policy">
1121	        <h3>Academic integrity <span class="k">INTEGRITY</span></h3>
1122	        <p>Submit your own work, cite the sources and tools you rely on, and don't misrepresent others' words or data as your own. When in doubt about what's allowed, ask first — it's always the safe move.</p>
1123	      </div>
1124	      <div class="policy">
1125	        <h3>Accessibility &amp; accommodations <span class="k">ACCESS</span></h3>
1126	        <p>Everyone deserves an equal path through this course. If any material or activity creates a barrier, reach out early and we'll arrange accommodations together, in coordination with disability services.</p>
1127	      </div>
1128	      <div class="policy">
1129	        <h3>Deadlines &amp; late work <span class="k">DEADLINES</span></h3>
1130	        <p>Discussions build a shared conversation, so they're due weekly — but your lowest one or two scores are dropped for the times life gets in the way. For assignments, reach out ahead of the due date if you need flexibility.</p>
1131	      </div>
1132	      <div class="policy">
1133	        <h3>Getting help <span class="k">SUPPORT</span></h3>
1134	        <p>Questions, office hours, meeting details, and instructor contact live on the course portal. No question is too basic — this course assumes no prior experience, and asking is how the class works.</p>
1135	      </div>
1136	      <div class="policy">
1137	        <h3>A note on this schedule <span class="k">CHANGES</span></h3>
1138	        <p>Topics, readings, and dates may shift as the term unfolds. The online schedule is always the source of truth — check it regularly for the current version.</p>
1139	      </div>
