638	      <!-- ===== WEEK 1 ===== -->
639	      <article class="week">
640	        <div class="node">01</div>
641	        <div class="card">
642	          <div class="card-top">
643	            <h3>Learning in a Digital &amp; AI Age</h3>
644	            <div style="display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap">
645	              <span class="due" style="color:var(--cobalt);background:var(--cobalt-wash);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cobalt) 30%,transparent)">Survey due</span>
646	              <span class="due">Due Jan 17</span>
647	            </div>
648	          </div>
649	          <p class="hook">Technology and AI are rewriting what it means to be a capable learner — this week you'll map that new landscape and find your place in it.</p>
650	          <div class="card-grid">
651	            <div>
652	              <p class="block-label">You will be able to</p>
653	              <ul class="objectives">
654	                <li>Describe how digital tools and AI are reshaping how we learn, work, and make decisions</li>
655	                <li>Set personal goals for building your computer and AI skills this term</li>
656	                <li>Identify your current strengths and gaps as a digital learner — without judgment</li>
657	                <li>Navigate the core tools and habits you'll use throughout this course</li>
658	              </ul>
659	              <div class="readings">
660	                <p class="block-label">Read / explore</p>
