663	                  <li><a class="r-title" href="https://www.unesco.org/en/articles/guidance-generative-ai-education-and-research" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Guidance for Generative AI in Education</a> · <span class="r-src">UNESCO, 2023</span><span class="r-why">Global policy framing for how learners should adapt to generative AI.</span></li>
664	                </ul>
665	              </div>
666	            </div>
