669	              <div class="concepts">
670	                <span class="chip">Digital literacy</span><span class="chip">AI-saturated world</span><span class="chip">Self-directed learning</span><span class="chip">Growth mindset</span>
671	              </div>
672	              <div class="why"><span class="tag">Why</span><span>Whatever your field, the ability to keep learning with new tools will shape your career more than any single skill you memorize.</span></div>
673	            </div>
