683	            <h3>Learning How to Learn</h3>
684	            <span class="due">Due Jan 24</span>
685	          </div>
686	          <p class="hook">There are science-backed ways to learn faster and remember longer — and once you know them, every future class gets easier.</p>
687	          <div class="card-grid">
688	            <div>
689	              <p class="block-label">You will be able to</p>
690	              <ul class="objectives">
691	                <li>Apply evidence-based techniques like spaced practice and retrieval to your coursework</li>
692	                <li>Explain how memory and attention work well enough to study smarter, not harder</li>
693	                <li>Use AI tools to support learning without letting them do the thinking for you</li>
694	                <li>Design a realistic weekly study plan that fits your life</li>
695	              </ul>
