700	                  <li><a class="r-title" href="https://barbaraoakley.com/dr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Free full course videos</a> · <span class="r-src">Barbara Oakley</span><span class="r-why">Openly hosted videos for direct, no-signup access to the core techniques.</span></li>
