721	            <span class="due">Due Jan 31</span>
722	          </div>
723	          <p class="hook">From email to shared docs to group chats, most work today happens online — this week you'll learn to communicate clearly and collaborate smoothly in digital spaces.</p>
724	          <div class="card-grid">
